# Retrofit dynamic partitions: the LP metadata lives in the physical system
# partition (LineageOS spreads the super over system + vendor + cust).
# Recovery maps the logical partitions from there, and system-image-upgrader
# makes room for the rootfs by dropping the ROM's own system_ext/product and
# growing the logical system (ro.boot.dynamic_partitions itself comes from the
# build tools, because the kernel command line has
# systempart=/dev/mapper/system).
on init
    setprop ro.boot.super_partition system
    setprop ro.boot.dynamic_partitions_retrofit true
    setprop ro.systemimage.system_partition_size 4096
    setprop ro.systemimage.remove_dynparts product,system_ext
